            <ArticleTitle>[Clinical and electroneuromyographical correlations in patients with lumbosacral pain syndrome in the complex therapy by the method of vertical underwater traction].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>51-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors have analyzed the efficiency of a complex treatment containing vertical underwater traction (VUT) method for patients with lumbosacral pain syndromes. The use of VUT in a complex treatment of patients with lumbosacral pain syndromes was determined to be effective by clinical data and positive indices of electroneuromyography.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
